[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5942.07, "timestamp": "01:39:02", "text": "我喝着它只是为了陪着你。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5943.51, "timestamp": "01:39:03", "text": "不喜欢他，但他不会是唯一一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5944.95, "timestamp": "01:39:04", "text": "谁在喝酒？我必须陪同我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5947.35, "timestamp": "01:39:07", "text": "我只是喝了那种垃圾酒而已。我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5955.59, "timestamp": "01:39:15", "text": "是的。所以，但是，但是我不知道，你是吗？你是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5958.47, "timestamp": "01:39:18", "text": "可以合法饮酒吗？我已达到法定饮酒年龄。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5962.55, "timestamp": "01:39:22", "text": "我在那里可以合法酒后驾车。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5964.07, "timestamp": "01:39:24", "text": "没关系。所以饮酒文化是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5966.47, "timestamp": "01:39:26", "text": "在日本真的很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5969.669, "timestamp": "01:39:29", "text": "这里比这里更有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5973.75, "timestamp": "01:39:33", "text": "我。我现在还不习惯喝酒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5976.95, "timestamp": "01:39:36", "text": "我试着把它当成一个有趣的故事来讲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5980.149, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "text": "就像我八年级或九年级的时候"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5980.4, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "driving license where "}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5980.936, "timestamp": "01:39:40", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "saiko he's uncle dayoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5983.91, "timestamp": "01:39:43", "text": "现在人们过去常常用号角来吹奏这个标准。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5986.27, "timestamp": "01:39:46", "text": "从他们家，我们过去常常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5989.47, "timestamp": "01:39:49", "text": "他们强迫我喝酒，还强迫我喝酒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time"